<ol class="steps">
  <li>Download or clone the <a href="https://github.com/glhrmbg/yt-experience" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">repository</a> and build the extension (<code>npm install && npm run build -w extension</code>).</li>
  <li>Open <code>brave://extensions</code> (or <code>chrome://extensions</code>) and enable <strong>Developer mode</strong>.</li>
  <li>Click <strong>Load unpacked</strong> and select the <code>extension/dist</code> folder.</li>
  <li>Open the extension's popup on any tab to toggle features on or off.</li>
</ol>

